Comment: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:05.90,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=3}{\an8\blur0.5\pos(994.14,8.94)}{\c&H292B2B&\3c&HCCCADB&\shad0}BEWARE OF\NPERVERTS!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So it wasn't a dream after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Master! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we should register you as my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just insert your finger into my va—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}First, we need to get you some \Nactual clothes and underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we're already halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you look like a cosplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But with that said...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing for you to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's still early, so I'm going to the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heading out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.27,0:00:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just go out commando!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've been cooped up in here ever since I arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.73,0:00:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I get so lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you tired, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.37,0:00:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me "Master" when we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So windy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite windy today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.55,0:01:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm {\i1}not{\i0} okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.73,0:01:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, the store's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.41,0:01:10.97,Alt,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we got some undies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}Now to find somewhere \Nfor her to put them on and head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Blocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Like I said, eye contact is not a signal to kiss me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.11,0:01:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, go in there and put them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}Surely she at least knows \Nher way around a restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she still in there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.16,0:01:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.66,0:01:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.09,0:01:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:01:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.69,0:02:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do your master registration here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.75,0:02:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.25,0:02:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't move unless you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but put the panties on first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do it for me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:17.37,Alt,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.29,0:02:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, well, raise your right leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I want to be able to serve you \Nas soon as possible, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Some of my functions \Nare unavailable until you register.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot satisfy you in this state, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.27,0:02:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me yours and yours alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.23,0:02:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:48.65,Alt,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I'll be right out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.49,0:02:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I nearly got caught up in the heat of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm looking forward to having you take off \Nthe underwear you got for me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Having someone else around isn't all that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, what did you just—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing! Just forget it! Why are you so fast?!
